{"hymn":"FR33","parent":"E207","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Quand nous pensons à Toi Seigneur","syl":{"n1":["Quand",null],"n2":["nous",null],"n3":["pen","i"],"n5":["sons","t"],"n7":["à",null],"n9":["Toi",null],"n11":["Sei","i"],"n12":["gneur,","t"],"n13":["À",null],"n14":["Ton",null],"n15":["a","i"],"n16":["mour,","t"],"n19":["Ta",null],"n20":["grâce,",null],"n21":["Le",null],"n22":["dé","i"],"n23":["sir","t"],"n24":["brule",null],"n25":["en",null],"n26":["no","i"],"n28":["tre","t"],"n29":["cœur",null],"n30":["De",null],"n32":["Te",null],"n33":["voir",null],"n34":["face",null],"n36":["à",null],"n37":["face.",null]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Quoique parfois lassés, chargés,","Les Tiens, ici, cheminent","En un lieu sec et désolé,","Où ne croit que l'épine."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Satisfaits pourtant, chaque jour,","S'attachant à Ta trace.","Ils peuvent chanter Ton amour","Et célébrer Ta grâce."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Toi, notre refuge et rocher,","Repos, salut, justice ;","De Toi, Seigneur, nous approcher,","Fait tout notre délice."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Sauveur béni qui nous soutient,","Tu fortifies Tes saints,","Jusqu'au jour où tous Tes vainqueurs,","Contempleront Ta gloire."]}]}